n<MyComponent hydrate-client={{ data: data.test }} />\r\n```\r\n\r\n`MyComponent.svelte`\r\n```html\r\n<script>\r\n  export let data;\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n{data}\r\n```\r\n\r\nLoading the Blog page executes `alert('Yo!')`. \r\n\r\nReported a similar issue in SvelteKit some months back https://github.com/sveltejs/kit/issues/721","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Elderjs/elderjs/issues/225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Elderjs/elderjs/issues/225/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]